Modified by Zion Sati: translated to C; explicit offset/repeated-element
descriptors replace compiler-generated member visitors; caller-published roots
replace global visitors; list membership encodes colours; counted pins replace
the separate pinned list; interior address lookup added; allocation-time
collection policy and injected allocator callbacks added. Static AssemblyScript
objects, renew/realloc and upstream finalization hooks are not carried over.
The core is non-moving. Independently written NetWasm lifetime extensions add
finalization, weak references and ephemerons; these are not AssemblyScript code.
